#: src/reference/reference/task.md:8
msgid "Task"
msgstr "任务"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:11
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:14
msgid ""
"A task is a unit of work in an sbt build. Tasks `compile` your code, run "
"`test`s incrementally, `package` JAR files, or do anything else a build "
"needs to do."
msgstr ""
"任务是 sbt 构建中的工作单元。任务可以 `compile` 代码、增量运行 `test`、"
"`package` JAR 文件，或执行构建所需的任何其他操作。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:18
msgid ""
"An interesting aspect of tasks is that they enable parallel programming, "
"similar to `Future[A]` and `IO[A]`. While `Future` and `IO` are often "
"composed via `for` comprehension, sbt provides _structured concurrency_ of "
"tasks via the direct-style `build.sbt` DSL."
msgstr ""
"任务的一个有趣之处在于，它们支持并行编程，类似于 `Future[A]` 和 `IO[A]`。"
"`Future` 和 `IO` 通常通过 `for` 推导式组合，而 sbt 通过直接风格的 `build.sbt` "
"DSL 提供任务的 _结构化并发_（_structured concurrency_）。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:24 src/reference/reference/task.md:25
#: src/reference/reference/task.md:26 src/reference/reference/task.md:466
msgid "\"\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:30
msgid "// intTaskA and intTaskB will run in parallel"
msgstr "// intTaskA 和 intTaskB 将并行运行"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:39
msgid "Def.Initialized\\[Task\\[A\\]\\]"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:41
msgid ""
"Under the hood, all tasks including task keys are typed as "
"`Def.Initialized[Task[A]]`."
msgstr "在底层，包括任务键在内的所有任务都被类型化为 `Def.Initialized[Task[A]]`。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:43
msgid ""
"`Def.Initialized[A]`. This is the same type as a setting, and used to "
"construct the setting/task graph at load time. It is so named because it "
"represents an initialized value of `A`."
msgstr ""
"`Def.Initialized[A]`。这与设置的类型相同，用于在加载时构建设置/任务图。"
"之所以如此命名，是因为它表示 `A` 的已初始化值。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:46
msgid ""
"`sbt.Task[A]`. This a datatype that represents repeatable asynchronous "
"computation. This is the part that gets executed by sbt's task engine."
msgstr ""
"`sbt.Task[A]`。这是一个表示可重复异步计算的数据类型，"
"是由 sbt 任务引擎执行的部分。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:50
msgid ""
"By nesting these together, a task can be read as a node in a setting/task "
"graph that produces an asynchronous computation of `A`."
msgstr "将这两者嵌套在一起，任务可被视为设置/任务图中的一个节点，用于产生 `A` 的异步计算。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:53
msgid "Settings vs tasks"
msgstr "设置与任务"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:55
msgid ""
"Both settings and tasks produce values, but there is a major difference "
"between them:"
msgstr "设置和任务都会产生值，但两者之间有一个重大区别："

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:58
msgid ""
"Settings are evaluated at build load time. Tasks are executed on demand, "
"often in response to the user invoking them from the shell."
msgstr "设置在构建加载时求值。任务按需执行，通常是响应用户从 shell 中调用。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:61
msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:63
msgid "There are several features of the task system:"
msgstr "任务系统具有以下几个特点："

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:65
msgid ""
"By integrating with the settings system, tasks can be added, removed, and "
"modified as easily as settings."
msgstr "通过与设置系统集成，任务可以像设置一样方便地添加、删除和修改。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:67
msgid ""
"Tasks produce values. Other tasks can access a task's value by calling "
"`value` on it within a task definition."
msgstr ""
"任务会产生值。其他任务可以在任务定义中对其调用 `value` 来访问该任务的值。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:69
msgid ""
"Task values are cached automatically based on its inputs. See [cached task]"
"(cached-task.md) for details."
msgstr "任务的值会根据其输入自动缓存。详情参见[缓存任务](cached-task.md)。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:71
msgid ""
"[Input tasks](input-task.md) use [parser combinators](tab-completion-"
"parser.md) to define the syntax for their arguments. This allows flexible "
"syntax and tab-completions in the same way as [commands](command.md)."
msgstr ""
"[输入任务](input-task.md)使用[解析器组合子](tab-completion-parser.md)定义参数语法，"
"从而与[命令](command.md)一样支持灵活的语法和 Tab 补全。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:75
msgid ""
"Dynamically changing the structure of the task graph is possible. Tasks can "
"be injected into the execution graph based on the result of another task."
msgstr ""
"可以动态更改任务图的结构。"
"任务可以根据另一个任务的结果注入执行图。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:78
msgid "There are ways to handle task failure, similar to `try/catch/finally`."
msgstr "有多种方式处理任务失败，类似于 `try/catch/finally`。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:80
msgid ""
"Each task has access to its own Logger that by default persists the logging "
"for that task at a more verbose level than is initially printed to the "
"screen."
msgstr ""
"每个任务都可以访问自己的 Logger，默认情况下，该 Logger 会以比最初打印到"
"屏幕更详细的级别保留该任务的日志。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:84
msgid "These features are discussed in detail in the following sections."
msgstr "以下各节将详细讨论这些功能。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:86
msgid "Defining a task"
msgstr "定义任务"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:89
msgid "Hello world example"
msgstr "Hello world 示例"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:91
msgid ""
"````admonish example title='build.sbt'\n"
"```scala\n"
"lazy val hello = taskKey[Unit](\"prints 'hello world'\")\n"
"\n"
"hello := println(\"hello world!\")\n"
"```\n"
"````"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:99
msgid ""
"Run `sbt hello` from command line to invoke the task. Run `sbt tasks` to see "
"this task listed."
msgstr "从命令行运行 `sbt hello` 来调用该任务。运行 `sbt tasks` 可查看此任务列表。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:102
msgid "Define the key"
msgstr "定义键"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:104
msgid "To declare a new task, define a lazy val of type `TaskKey`:"
msgstr "要声明一个新任务，需定义一个 `TaskKey` 类型的 lazy val："

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:107
msgid "\"A sample task.\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:110
msgid ""
"The name of the `val` is used when referring to the task in `build.sbt` and "
"at the command line. The string passed to the `taskKey` method is a "
"description of the task. The type parameter passed to `taskKey` (here, "
"`Int`) is the type of value produced by the task."
msgstr ""
"`val` 的名称用于在 `build.sbt` 和命令行中引用该任务。"
"传递给 `taskKey` 方法的字符串是任务的描述。"
"传递给 `taskKey` 的类型参数（此处为 `Int`）是任务产生的值的类型。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:115
msgid "We'll define a couple of other keys for the examples:"
msgstr "我们为示例再定义几个键："

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:117
msgid ""
"````admonish example title='build.sbt'\n"
"```scala\n"
"lazy val intTask = taskKey[Int](\"An int task\")\n"
"lazy val stringTask = taskKey[String](\"A string task\")\n"
"```\n"
"````"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:124
msgid "The examples themselves are valid entries in a `build.sbt`."
msgstr "这些示例本身就是 `build.sbt` 中的有效条目。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:126
msgid "Implement the task"
msgstr "实现任务"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:128
msgid ""
"There are three main parts to implementing a task once its key is defined:"
msgstr "定义键之后，实现任务主要分为三个部分："

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:131
msgid ""
"Determine the settings and other tasks needed by the task. They are the "
"task's inputs."
msgstr "确定任务所需的设置和其他任务，它们是任务的输入。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:133
msgid "Define the code that implements the task in terms of these inputs."
msgstr "根据这些输入定义实现任务的代码。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:134
msgid "Determine the scope the task will go in."
msgstr "确定任务所在的作用域。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:136
msgid ""
"These parts are then combined just like the parts of a setting are combined."
msgstr "这些部分的组合方式与设置的各部分组合方式相同。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:139
msgid "Defining a basic task"
msgstr "定义基本任务"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:141
msgid "A task is defined using `:=`"
msgstr "任务使用 `:=` 定义"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:143
msgid ""
"````admonish example title='build.sbt'\n"
"```scala\n"
"lazy val intTask = taskKey[Int](\"An int task\")\n"
"lazy val stringTask = taskKey[String](\"A string task\")\n"
"\n"
"intTask := 1 + 2\n"
"\n"
"stringTask := Def.uncached {\n"
"  sys.props(\"user.name\")\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
"````"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:156
msgid "Tasks with inputs"
msgstr "带输入的任务"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:158
msgid ""
"Tasks with other tasks or settings as inputs are also defined using `:=`. "
"The values of the inputs are referenced by the `value` method. This method "
"is a special syntax and can only be called when defining a task, such as in "
"the argument to `:=`. The following defines a task that adds one to the "
"value produced by `intTask` and returns the result."
msgstr ""
"以其他任务或设置为输入的任务同样使用 `:=` 定义。输入的值通过 `value` 方法引用。"
"该方法是一种特殊语法，只能在定义任务时调用，例如作为 `:=` 的参数。"
"以下示例定义了一个将 `intTask` 的结果加一并返回的任务。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:168
msgid "Multiple settings are handled similarly:"
msgstr "多个设置的处理方式类似："

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:174
msgid "s\"sample: $x, int: $i\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:178
msgid "Task scope"
msgstr "任务作用域"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:180
msgid ""
"As with settings, tasks can be defined in a specific scope. For example, "
"there are separate `compile` tasks for the `Compile` and `Test` scopes."
msgstr ""
"与设置一样，任务也可以在特定作用域中定义。"
"例如，`Compile` 和 `Test` 作用域各有单独的 `compile` 任务。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:183
msgid ""
"In the following example, `Test/sampleTask` uses the result of `Compile/"
"intTask`:"
msgstr "在以下示例中，`Test/sampleTask` 使用了 `Compile/intTask` 的结果："

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:190
msgid ""
"````admonish note title='On operator precedence'\n"
"As a reminder, infix method precedence is determined by the name of the "
"method.\n"
"\n"
"1.  Assignment methods have the lowest precedence. These are methods\n"
"    with names ending in `=`, except for `!=`, `<=`, `>=`, and names that\n"
"    start with `=`.\n"
"2.  Methods starting with a letter have the next highest precedence.\n"
"3.  Methods with names that start with a symbol and aren't included in\n"
"    1 have the highest precedence. (This category is divided further\n"
"    according to the specific character it starts with. See the Scala\n"
"    specification for details.)\n"
"\n"
"Therefore, the previous example is equivalent to the following:\n"
"\n"
"```scala\n"
"(Test / sampleTask).:=((Compile / intTask).value * 3)\n"
"```\n"
"````"
msgstr ""
"````admonish note title='关于运算符优先级'\n"
"提醒一下，中缀方法的优先级由方法名决定。\n"
"\n"
"1.  赋值方法的优先级最低。这些方法的名称以 `=` 结尾，\n"
"    但 `!=`、`<=`、`>=` 以及以 `=` 开头的名称除外。\n"
"2.  以字母开头的方法优先级次之。\n"
"3.  以符号开头且不属于第 1 类的方法优先级最高。\n"
"    （该类别根据具体的首字符进一步细分，详见 Scala 规范。）\n"
"\n"
"因此，前面的示例等价于以下写法：\n"
"\n"
"```scala\n"
"(Test / sampleTask).:=((Compile / intTask).value * 3)\n"
"```\n"
"````"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:209
msgid "Separating implementations"
msgstr "分离实现"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:211
msgid ""
"The implementation of a task can be separated from the binding. For example, "
"a basic separate definition looks like:"
msgstr "任务的实现可以与绑定分离。例如，基本的分离定义如下："

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:215
msgid "// Define a new, standalone task implemention"
msgstr "// 定义一个新的独立任务实现"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:218
msgid "// Bind the implementation to a specific key"
msgstr "// 将实现绑定到特定键"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:223
msgid ""
"Note that whenever `.value` is used, it must be within a task definition, "
"such as within `Def.task` above or as an argument to `:=`."
msgstr ""
"请注意，无论何时使用 `.value`，都必须在任务定义内部，"
"例如在上述 `Def.task` 中或作为 `:=` 的参数。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:226
msgid "Modifying an existing task"
msgstr "修改现有任务"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:228
msgid ""
"In the general case, modify a task by declaring the previous task as an "
"input."
msgstr "一般情况下，通过将前一个任务声明为输入来修改任务。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:232
msgid "// initial definition"
msgstr "// 初始定义"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:234
msgid "// overriding definition that references the previous definition"
msgstr "// 引用前一个定义的覆盖定义"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:239
msgid ""
"Completely override a task by not declaring the previous task as an input. "
"Each of the definitions in the following example completely overrides the "
"previous one. That is, when `intTask` is run, it will only print `#3`."
msgstr ""
"通过不将前一个任务声明为输入来完全覆盖任务。"
"以下示例中的每个定义都完全覆盖前一个定义。"
"即运行 `intTask` 时只会打印 `#3`。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:246
msgid "\"#1\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:251
msgid "\"#2\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:256
msgid "\"#3\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:261
msgid "Error handling"
msgstr "错误处理"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:264
msgid "Errors in a task"
msgstr "任务中的错误"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:266
msgid "To express an error state in a task, throw an exception. For example:"
msgstr "要在任务中表示错误状态，请抛出异常。例如："

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:269
msgid ""
"````admonish example title='build.sbt'\n"
"```scala\n"
"lazy val intTask = taskKey[Int](\"An int task\")\n"
"\n"
"intTask := sys.error(\"failed\")\n"
"```\n"
"````"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:277
msgid ""
"sbt's task engine will catch and handling the error without crashing sbt:"
msgstr "sbt 的任务引擎会捕获并处理该错误，而不会导致 sbt 崩溃："

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:286
msgid "The stacktrace can be shown using `last intTask`."
msgstr "可以使用 `last intTask` 查看堆栈跟踪。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:288
msgid "`result`"
msgstr "`result`"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:290
msgid ""
"The `result` method creates a new task that returns the full `Result[A1]` "
"value for the original task. `Result` has the same structure as "
"`Either[Incomplete, A1]` for a task result of type `A1`. That is, it has two "
"subtypes:"
msgstr ""
"`result` 方法创建一个新任务，返回原任务的完整 `Result[A1]` 值。"
"`Result` 的结构与类型为 `A1` 的任务结果的 `Either[Incomplete, A1]` 相同，"
"即有两个子类型："

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:295
msgid "`Result.Inc`, which wraps `Incomplete` in case of failure"
msgstr "`Result.Inc`：在失败时包装 `Incomplete`"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:296
msgid "`Result.Value`, which wraps a task's result in case of success."
msgstr "`Result.Value`：在成功时包装任务的结果。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:298
msgid ""
"Thus, the task created by `result` executes whether or not the original task "
"succeeds or fails."
msgstr "因此，由 `result` 创建的任务无论原始任务成功还是失败都会执行。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:301
msgid ""
"````admonish example title='build.sbt'\n"
"```scala\n"
"lazy val intTask = taskKey[Int](\"An int task\")\n"
"\n"
"intTask := sys.error(\"boom\")\n"
"\n"
"intTask := Def.uncached {\n"
"  intTask.result.value match\n"
"    case Result.Inc(inc: Incomplete) =>\n"
"      println(\"Ignoring failure: \" + inc)\n"
"      3\n"
"    case Result.Value(v) =>\n"
"      println(\"Using successful result: \" + v)\n"
"      v\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
"````"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:319
msgid ""
"This rewires the original `intTask` definition so that if the original task "
"fails, the exception is printed and the constant `3` is returned. If it "
"succeeds, the value is printed and returned."
msgstr ""
"这将重新连接原始 `intTask` 定义，使得原始任务失败时打印异常并返回常量 `3`，"
"成功时打印并返回其值。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:323
msgid "`failure`"
msgstr "`failure`"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:325
msgid ""
"The `failure` method creates a new task that returns the `Incomplete` value "
"when the original task fails to complete normally. If the original task "
"succeeds, the new task fails."
msgstr ""
"`failure` 方法创建一个新任务，当原始任务未能正常完成时返回 `Incomplete` 值。"
"如果原始任务成功，则新任务失败。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:329
msgid ""
"````admonish example title='build.sbt'\n"
"```scala\n"
"lazy val intTask = taskKey[Int](\"An int task\")\n"
"\n"
"intTask := sys.error(\"boom\")\n"
"\n"
"intTask := Def.uncached {\n"
"  println(\"Ignoring failure: \" + intTask.failure.value)\n"
"  3\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
"````"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:342
msgid ""
"This rewires the `intTask` so that the original exception is printed and the "
"constant `3` is returned."
msgstr "这将重新连接 `intTask`，使其打印原始异常并返回常量 `3`。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:345
msgid "Advanced task operations"
msgstr "任务的进阶功能"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:348
msgid "Streams: Per-task logging"
msgstr "Streams：按任务记录日志"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:350
msgid ""
"Per-task loggers are part of a more general system for task-specific data "
"called Streams."
msgstr "按任务记录日志是名为 Streams 的任务特定数据通用系统的一部分。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:353
msgid ""
"To use Streams, get the value of the `streams` task. A logger can be "
"obtained by the `log` method:"
msgstr ""
"要使用 Streams，获取 `streams` 任务的值。"
"可以通过 `log` 方法获取 Logger："

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:359
msgid "\"Saying hi...\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:360
msgid "\"Hello!\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:364
msgid "You can scope logging settings by the specific task's scope:"
msgstr "可以按特定任务的作用域来限定日志设置的范围："

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:371
msgid "To obtain the last logging output from a task, use the `last` command:"
msgstr "要获取任务的最后一次日志输出，使用 `last` 命令："

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:379
msgid ""
"The verbosity with which logging is persisted is controlled using the "
"`persistLogLevel` and `persistTraceLevel` settings. The `last` command "
"displays what was logged according to these levels. The levels do not affect "
"already logged information."
msgstr ""
"日志的保存详细程度由 `persistLogLevel` 和 `persistTraceLevel` 设置控制。"
"`last` 命令根据这些级别显示已记录的内容。"
"这些级别不影响已记录的信息。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:384
msgid "Conditional task"
msgstr "条件任务"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:386
msgid ""
"When a task consists of an `if`\\-expression at the top-level, a conditional "
"task is automatically created:"
msgstr "当任务的顶层由 `if` 表达式构成时，会自动创建条件任务："

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:396
msgid ""
"Unlike the regular (Applicative) task composition, conditional tasks delays "
"the evaluation of then-clause and else-clause as naturally expected of an "
"`if`\\-expression. This is already possible with `Def.taskDyn { ... }`, but "
"unlike dynamic tasks, conditional task works with `inspect` command."
msgstr ""
"与常规（应用函子式）任务组合不同，条件任务会像 `if` 表达式自然期望的那样"
"延迟对 then 子句和 else 子句的求值。这在 `Def.taskDyn { ... }` 中已经可以实现，"
"但与动态任务不同，条件任务可以与 `inspect` 命令配合使用。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:398
msgid "<a name=\"dynamic\"></a>"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:399
msgid "Dynamic Computations with `Def.taskDyn`"
msgstr "使用 `Def.taskDyn` 的动态计算"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:401
msgid ""
"It can be useful to use the result of a task to determine the next tasks to "
"evaluate. This is done using `Def.taskDyn`."
msgstr ""
"利用任务的结果来决定下一步要求值的任务有时很有用，"
"这可以通过 `Def.taskDyn` 实现。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:404
msgid ""
"The result of `taskDyn` is called a dynamic task because it introduces "
"dependencies at runtime. The `taskDyn` method supports the same syntax as "
"`Def.task` and `:=` except that you return a task instead of a plain value."
msgstr ""
"`taskDyn` 的结果称为动态任务，因为它在运行时引入依赖关系。"
"`taskDyn` 方法支持与 `Def.task` 和 `:=` 相同的语法，"
"区别在于返回的是任务而非普通值。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:409
msgid "For example,"
msgstr "例如，"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:411
msgid ""
"````admonish example title='build.sbt'\n"
"```scala\n"
"lazy val stringTask = taskKey[String](\"A string task\")\n"
"lazy val intTask = taskKey[Int](\"An int task\")\n"
"lazy val foo = taskKey[Int](\"foo\")\n"
"\n"
"val dynamic = Def.taskDyn {\n"
"  // decide what to evaluate based on the value of `stringTask`\n"
"  if stringTask.value == \"dev\" then\n"
"    // create the dev-mode task: this is only evaluated if the\n"
"    //   value of stringTask is \"dev\"\n"
"    Def.task {\n"
"      3\n"
"    }\n"
"  else\n"
"    // create the production task: only evaluated if the value\n"
"    //    of the stringTask is not \"dev\"\n"
"    Def.task {\n"
"      intTask.value + 5\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"stringTask := \"test\"\n"
"intTask := 1\n"
"\n"
"foo := Def.uncached {\n"
"  val num = dynamic.value\n"
"  println(s\"number selected was $num\")\n"
"  num\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
"````"
msgstr ""
"````admonish example title='build.sbt'\n"
"```scala\n"
"lazy val stringTask = taskKey[String](\"A string task\")\n"
"lazy val intTask = taskKey[Int](\"An int task\")\n"
"lazy val foo = taskKey[Int](\"foo\")\n"
"\n"
"val dynamic = Def.taskDyn {\n"
"  // 根据 `stringTask` 的值决定要求值的内容\n"
"  if stringTask.value == \"dev\" then\n"
"    // 创建 dev 模式任务：仅在 stringTask 的值为 \"dev\" 时求值\n"
"    Def.task {\n"
"      3\n"
"    }\n"
"  else\n"
"    // 创建生产任务：仅在 stringTask 的值不为 \"dev\" 时求值\n"
"    Def.task {\n"
"      intTask.value + 5\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"stringTask := \"test\"\n"
"intTask := 1\n"
"\n"
"foo := Def.uncached {\n"
"  val num = dynamic.value\n"
"  println(s\"number selected was $num\")\n"
"  num\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
"````"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:444
msgid ""
"The only static dependency of `foo` is `stringTask`. The dependency on "
"`intTask` is only introduced in non-dev mode."
msgstr "`foo` 唯一的静态依赖是 `stringTask`。对 `intTask` 的依赖仅在非 dev 模式下引入。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:447
msgid ""
"```admonish warning\n"
"A dynamic task cannot refer to itself or a circular dependency will\n"
"result. In the example above, there would be a circular dependency if\n"
"the code passed to taskDyn referenced `foo`.\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```admonish warning\n"
"动态任务不能引用自身，否则会产生循环依赖。在上面的示例中，\n"
"如果传递给 taskDyn 的代码引用了 `foo`，就会产生循环依赖。\n"
"```"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:453
msgid "Using `Def.sequential`"
msgstr "使用 `Def.sequential`"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:455
msgid ""
"`Def.sequential` is a helper function to define a semi-sequential task. This "
"is similar to the dynamic task, but easier to define. To demonstrate the "
"sequential task, let's create a custom task called `compilecheck` that runs "
"`Compile / compile` and then `Compile / scalastyle` task."
msgstr ""
"`Def.sequential` 是用于定义半顺序任务的辅助函数，与动态任务类似，但更易定义。"
"为演示顺序任务，我们创建一个名为 `compilecheck` 的自定义任务，"
"依次运行 `Compile / compile` 和 `Compile / scalastyle`。"

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:460
msgid "\"compile and then scalastyle\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:462
msgid "\".\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/task.md:471
msgid ""
"For a completely sequential execution, use [commands](command.md) instead."
msgstr "若需完全顺序执行，请改用[命令](command.md)。"

